                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30506b6d-78e9-32cd-bd7d-a43fca32cecd",
                        "entry_id": "7057ddd7-e098-3743-97b4-eb7e971798e3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "торг. форма комиссионной продажи товаров, при которой их владелец (консигнант) передаёт комиссионеру (консигнатору) товар для продажи со склада последнего, т. е. предоставляет товар в распоряжение комиссионера на определённое время для реализации"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6277ab89-3ae8-4c71-b891-5aa0eac7c02e",
                                "sense_id": "30506b6d-78e9-32cd-bd7d-a43fca32cecd",
                                "text": "Таким образом, по договору консигнации одна сторона (консигнатор) обязуется по поручению другой стороны (консигнанта) за вознаграждение принимать на хранение товары, принадлежащие консигнанту, и осуществлять реализацию данных товаров третьим лицам от имени консигнанта или от своего имени, а также возвращать товары консигнанту или передавать товары по его указанию третьим лицам."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "088b822b-df46-42fd-9402-637e064ada50",
                        "source_entry_id": "7057ddd7-e098-3743-97b4-eb7e971798e3",
                        "source_sense_id": "30506b6d-78e9-32cd-bd7d-a43fca32cecd",
                        "target_lang_word": "consignation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "consignation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc7298dd-987e-320d-945a-3f7c41ae70d5",
                                        "entry_id": "ab8093e2-4faf-31fe-9e9f-8e4ed7e748ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of consigning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "392c12b1-55b3-47fa-91c4-62ebd016d466",
                                                "sense_id": "fc7298dd-987e-320d-945a-3f7c41ae70d5",
                                                "text": "So is despair a certain consignation to eternal ruin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d0f0c9f-dcf4-427f-bcfd-082d92eccd83",
                                                "sense_id": "fc7298dd-987e-320d-945a-3f7c41ae70d5",
                                                "text": "Now there are some that have understood that this state of happiness, and this state of misery of the soul, before the resurrection, was a first resurrection. Yea, I admit it may be termed a resurrection; the raising of the spirit or the soul, and their consignation to happiness or misery, according to the words which have been spoken."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "839edcd6-84f5-4bd9-a59c-7da82fcb382c",
                                                "sense_id": "fc7298dd-987e-320d-945a-3f7c41ae70d5",
                                                "text": "military consignations and the holding ready of troops are almost uniformly resorted to during great strikes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d81cb46-060b-3284-aa7f-aed4cb25d550",
                                        "entry_id": "ab8093e2-4faf-31fe-9e9f-8e4ed7e748ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of ratifying or establishing; confirmation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b7546d9-8c2e-4557-ac4d-cbdcc5714eb0",
                                                "sense_id": "3d81cb46-060b-3284-aa7f-aed4cb25d550",
                                                "text": "[W]e may look upon the tradition of the holy Sacramental Symbols as a direct conſignation of pardon; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10a98867-b279-48f4-bd74-86aafd26daaa",
                                                "sense_id": "3d81cb46-060b-3284-aa7f-aed4cb25d550",
                                                "text": "A terrible thought seized me. Perhaps he had not made his escape! I cast one glance at the burning pile, and, to my consignation, beheld the flames already bursting from the roof."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0cf163bd-f3e0-31af-81b8-b31197796619",
                                        "entry_id": "ab8093e2-4faf-31fe-9e9f-8e4ed7e748ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stamp; an indication."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "809670f8-f721-41af-b6f3-fbbdc42e3052",
                                                "sense_id": "0cf163bd-f3e0-31af-81b8-b31197796619",
                                                "text": ", \"Of Growth in Sin\"\nThe most certain consignations of an excellent virtue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
